#: nsfw.php:65
msgid ""
"This addon searches for specified words/text in posts and collapses them. It"
" can be used to filter content tagged with for instance #NSFW that may be "
"deemed inappropriate at certain times or places, such as being at work. It "
"is also useful for hiding irrelevant or annoying content from direct view."
msgstr "This addon searches for specified words/text in posts and collapses them. It can be used to filter content tagged with for instance #NSFW that may be deemed inappropriate at certain times or places, such as being at work. It is also useful for hiding irrelevant or annoying content from direct view."

